<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Ngu=
=E1=BB=93n G=E1=BB=91c: John Ousterhout's Insights on Complexity</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Problem Statement Chi Ti=
=E1=BA=BFt:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Khi t=C3=B4i =C4=91=E1=BB=8Dc "A=
 Philosophy of Software Design" c=E1=BB=A7a John Ousterhout (Professor t=E1=
