<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=92=A1 Int=
uitive Understanding: State v=C3=A0 Control Problems</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Restaurant Kitchen Analo=
gy:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>High State/Control Compl=
exity (Bad Kitchen):</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Chefs share same cutting board,=
 ingredients scattered</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">No clear order of operations</l=
i>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Each chef modifies shared recip=
e book</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Kitchen state constantly changi=
ng</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Orders interfere v=E1=BB=9Bi ea=
ch other</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Impossible to predict cooking t=
ime</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Low State/Control Comple=
xity (Good Kitchen):</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Each chef has dedicated workspa=
ce (immutable state)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Clear recipe cards (pure functi=
ons)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Ingredients prepared in advance=
 (data transformation)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Clear cooking sequence (simple =
control flow)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">No shared mutable state</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Predictable cooking process</li=
>
</ul>
